{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-413",
  "title": "Tehcnical Assessment",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Tehcnical Assessment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi Sample User,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Thank you for completing your personality and cognitive assessments — you’re making great progress!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We're now inviting you to move forward with the **Frontend Engineer Technical Assessment** portion of the process. You may begin this challenge **immediately**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This task is designed to simulate a real-world scenario, giving you the chance to showcase your skills. We’re not looking for perfection — we want to see how you solve problems and communicate effectively."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assessment Overview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Role:** Frontend Engineer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Challenge:** Build an AI-integrated web app with clean UI and solid architecture"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Stack:** React, Angular, HTML/CSS/JS (your choice)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Deadline:** 7 days from today"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Objective"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Create a lightweight app where a user can input a prompt, submit it to an AI API (e.g., OpenAI), and receive/display a response. Focus on:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Prompt input + submit button"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fetching from OpenAI or HuggingFace"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Displaying results dynamically"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Error handling and loading states"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Bonus (+10 pts)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Save and show past prompts/responses (chat history)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Include a “Clear” button for the user"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Submission Instructions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Create a public GitHub repository"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Include a simple `README.md` with setup instructions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Wait for the technical recruiter to contact you then share the link"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Important:** You do *not* need to wait for your live interview before beginning this challenge. Start whenever you are ready."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you have questions or hit a blocker, don’t hesitate to reach out."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Best of luck!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Servimatt Recruitment Team**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}